{"c":[{"name":"20261009T082841Z-f6fa2a2274a3373e","text":"v2/access (2026-10-09) has no .github/workflows/v2.yml or record-snapshots.yml; those live on sam/v2/ci with Swift 6.3 perch fixes, so CI for a branch off v2/access needs a carrier commit with them pushed to a v2/** branch (and snapshots/record).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T105258Z-d4c8517ede3130a0","text":"realfill-asks.ts records firstGate per Ask (planner/ask.ts Gate) and now logs Jev's per-option probabilities in --log-jev; replaying a log from before 2026-10-09 can't reproduce routeBetween (readHead needs probabilities).","type":"note"}]}
